WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.848
Shoppable images in your store help customers see your products in context, engage with their

00:00:06.848 --> 00:00:10.500
details, and add them directly to their carts.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.750
If you're using the product highlight or

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:18.214
marquee template, or if you've added a split width section to your page, you can see empty

00:00:18.214 --> 00:00:19.500
tiles ready for you.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.136
Click on a tile and find Shoppable Image.

00:00:23.136 --> 00:00:24.955
Upload a lifestyle image

00:00:24.955 --> 00:00:29.500
showing at least one product, then add the products featured.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.875
You can adjust where

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:35.000
they're active on the image and add more, up to six products.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Click Save.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:37.500
You can

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.000
also add a shoppable Image as the only full width tile in a section.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Add a new

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
section and your shoppable Image in the same way.
